/P 4440 0 R
/E (To minimize risk of injury, you should have a base of at least 3 weeks of 12-15 miles a week before starting this plan, and feel comfortable with a 10k \(6.1 mile\) long run. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 4441 0 R
/E (You can modify the plan to 3 days of running per week, flexing Mondays. If modifying, strength and/or cross training, 30-60 minutes, doing low-impact cardio such as cycling or elliptical, or weight training. For core work, focus on exercises that strengthen your core.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 4442 0 R
