<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 4447 0 R
/E (Rest and fueling your body well are critical for the wellness of endurance athletes. Hydrate, rest, eat what your body needs, and prioritize you. Do not compare your journey to others, do what is best for you!)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
1258 0 obj
